WEBVTT

00:41.916 --> 00:46.963
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

00:47.046 --> 00:48.965
EPISODE 10

00:57.182 --> 00:58.308
Hee-joo.

01:02.729 --> 01:04.272
Did you sleep well?

01:04.355 --> 01:05.356
Yeah.

01:07.192 --> 01:09.527
I want to sleep more.

01:11.571 --> 01:13.239
Go back to sleep.

01:15.492 --> 01:17.494
- But you'll be late for work.
- What?

01:19.120 --> 01:20.080
What time is it?

01:20.663 --> 01:21.998
- Right now?
- Yeah.

01:22.916 --> 01:23.875
It's Saturday.

01:23.958 --> 01:25.835
I can't believe you!

01:27.337 --> 01:28.296
Get up.

01:28.379 --> 01:29.964
Don't.

01:30.799 --> 01:32.091
- Get up.
- Don't!

01:32.175 --> 01:33.384
I had a dream.

01:34.511 --> 01:35.678
The toothpaste!

01:35.762 --> 01:38.598
Squeeze it from the bottom
and not the middle!

01:38.681 --> 01:40.767
How many times have I told you?

01:42.560 --> 01:44.813
Who takes off their clothes
inside out like this?

01:46.022 --> 01:46.856
What about you?

01:47.357 --> 01:49.317
You always do that with your socks.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.401
When did I do that?

01:50.485 --> 01:52.695
All the time.
So when I put it in the basket,

01:52.779 --> 01:55.073
- I do this.
- When? Tell me the exact time.

01:55.156 --> 01:56.908
- So childish.
- I am not.

01:57.700 --> 01:59.327
In the dream,

01:59.953 --> 02:02.831
we were ordinary just like everyone else.

02:06.251 --> 02:09.629
The peaceful happiness
everyone gets to enjoy in life.

02:11.548 --> 02:14.300
Why was that so hard for us?

02:16.761 --> 02:17.887
We just…

02:19.305 --> 02:22.392
wanted to love and rely on each other,

02:24.811 --> 02:26.271
cherish each other,

02:27.021 --> 02:29.732
and stay together for a long, long time.

02:37.073 --> 02:39.242
SPOKESPERSON PAIK SA-EON

02:50.503 --> 02:52.881
NAME: PARK DO-JAE
NAME BEFORE ADOPTION: YUN MIN-SEONG

02:55.717 --> 02:56.801
HEE-JOO

02:57.510 --> 02:59.095
The person you're calling is…

03:13.776 --> 03:14.944
What the hell?

03:18.364 --> 03:19.407
Where is he?

03:25.413 --> 03:27.624
PAIK SA-EON'S COMING TOO,
LET'S PLAY TOGETHER.

03:52.982 --> 03:54.484
I thought he wanted to play.

03:55.693 --> 03:57.028
Where did he go?

04:05.912 --> 04:06.746
Is it you?

04:09.082 --> 04:10.583
Are you "Master"?

04:22.512 --> 04:24.138
The negotiation team's timeline.

04:31.980 --> 04:33.439
OFFICE BUILDING FIRE IN YEOUIDO

04:36.693 --> 04:37.527
Did you see it?

04:38.486 --> 04:39.445
What do you think?

04:44.117 --> 04:46.327
Don't act alone from now on.

04:47.996 --> 04:50.373
So why did you leave me out?

04:50.456 --> 04:52.375
I want to join in on the fun too.

04:55.128 --> 04:56.296
I'll give you a job.

04:57.255 --> 05:00.425
Make sure she doesn't back out.

05:03.303 --> 05:05.346
YONGJU SILVER CARE HOSPITAL

05:11.602 --> 05:13.187
Where's Hong Hee-joo?

05:20.361 --> 05:21.821
So why did you lie?

05:22.655 --> 05:24.282
You're the one who lied!

05:30.705 --> 05:31.789
Sir?

05:31.873 --> 05:33.541
A call came in a moment ago.

05:33.624 --> 05:34.542
This…

06:00.693 --> 06:02.987
JUAN FISHING

06:03.071 --> 06:06.199
JUAN FISHING

06:19.462 --> 06:20.588
Going somewhere?

06:26.427 --> 06:27.261
Why?

06:28.221 --> 06:31.557
Did you do something that made you want
to run away from me?

06:32.517 --> 06:34.519
- Stop.
- What do you mean?

06:34.602 --> 06:37.021
I know you're the one behind it all.

06:38.940 --> 06:40.149
Leave him alone.

06:40.233 --> 06:41.234
Right.

06:43.736 --> 06:45.404
You must've seen my face

06:46.072 --> 06:47.406
on the news.

06:49.242 --> 06:50.076
So what?

06:54.956 --> 06:57.792
Did you tell that bastard?

06:58.501 --> 06:59.335
That kid…

07:00.837 --> 07:02.171
did nothing wrong.

07:02.755 --> 07:05.967
It was your grandfather and parents
who tried to kill you.

07:06.759 --> 07:10.429
Why are you trying to take revenge
on the wrong person?

07:14.142 --> 07:17.186
What do you mean, he did nothing wrong?

07:18.312 --> 07:21.941
He's enjoyed my life for decades.

07:22.942 --> 07:25.945
He got to live under my name!

07:26.612 --> 07:28.322
I never should've let you live.

07:28.948 --> 07:31.117
When Paik Jang-ho tried to kill you,

07:32.160 --> 07:33.828
I should've let him.

07:35.955 --> 07:37.790
There's no point in regretting it now.

07:38.374 --> 07:39.625
It's too late.

07:40.501 --> 07:41.794
Don't get in the way.

07:42.753 --> 07:44.130
Don't take his side either.

07:44.213 --> 07:47.383
I'm going to…

07:48.384 --> 07:49.594
destroy him.

07:55.766 --> 07:59.061
You're the real Paik Sa-eon.

08:00.563 --> 08:01.439
You caught me.

08:03.733 --> 08:06.444
Is that why you used Hong Hee-joo as bait

08:07.111 --> 08:08.529
to lure me in?

08:09.530 --> 08:10.990
Did you call Paik Sa-eon too?

08:11.782 --> 08:13.826
The three of us should meet
and talk face-to-face.

08:13.910 --> 08:14.744
Yeah.

08:15.453 --> 08:17.121
I'll give you your chance,

08:17.663 --> 08:18.789
so shut up and wait.

08:33.930 --> 08:35.640
I don't need you anymore.

08:35.723 --> 08:36.974
Goodbye.

08:57.662 --> 08:58.871
SECRETARIAT
PRESIDENTIAL OFFICE

09:00.289 --> 09:01.749
What's this?

09:03.084 --> 09:04.502
You bastard!

09:05.086 --> 09:07.255
Were you one of Paik Sa-eon's lackeys?

09:09.298 --> 09:10.508
Then let's play some more.

09:13.010 --> 09:14.554
This is going to be fun!

09:31.821 --> 09:33.531
UNKNOWN CALLER

09:35.825 --> 09:36.909
Let's play,

09:37.618 --> 09:38.703
Paik Sa-eon.

09:39.912 --> 09:41.581
If you bring the cops,

09:42.248 --> 09:44.166
Hong Hee-joo dies.

09:45.418 --> 09:46.377
Got it?

10:17.450 --> 10:19.243
Play with me.

10:20.369 --> 10:22.663
Let's play, Paik Sa-eon.

10:28.711 --> 10:29.545
Hee-joo…

10:50.524 --> 10:51.359
Hee-joo.

11:03.954 --> 11:04.789
Park Do-jae.

11:06.540 --> 11:08.042
Park Do-jae, wake up.

11:08.668 --> 11:09.960
Wake up, Do-jae!

11:16.676 --> 11:17.885
Where's Hee-joo?

11:17.968 --> 11:19.553
What did you do with her?

11:19.637 --> 11:22.390
He's here…

11:36.904 --> 11:37.738
Hee-joo!

11:38.531 --> 11:39.448
Hee-joo!

11:40.449 --> 11:41.951
Yeah!

11:43.494 --> 11:44.662
Come on.

11:45.329 --> 11:46.497
Hee-joo!

11:46.580 --> 11:47.540
Hee-joo!

11:53.671 --> 11:54.839
Are you up, Sis?

11:59.176 --> 12:00.261
Hee-joo!

12:01.345 --> 12:02.555
Stop.

12:02.638 --> 12:03.764
I don't want to.

12:04.890 --> 12:06.517
Stop the car, asshole!

12:14.817 --> 12:15.943
Hee-joo!

12:18.654 --> 12:19.822
Are you okay?

12:20.489 --> 12:22.199
- Were you hurt?
- I'm fine.

12:33.461 --> 12:34.378
Are you okay?

12:46.015 --> 12:46.891
Is it you?

12:47.933 --> 12:49.018
Are you him?

12:49.101 --> 12:50.269
You look…

12:51.520 --> 12:52.688
great.

12:53.314 --> 12:56.859
For someone who used to fish
with your bare hands here.

12:57.443 --> 12:59.069
So, what is it that you want?

12:59.820 --> 13:01.197
Your name? Your place?

13:01.864 --> 13:02.865
Do you want them back?

13:04.283 --> 13:05.117
Really?

13:05.201 --> 13:06.035
Yeah!

13:06.660 --> 13:08.496
Take them all back!

13:10.289 --> 13:12.124
I never wanted them in the first place.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.710
Just take them all back!

13:16.003 --> 13:17.254
Really?

13:18.255 --> 13:19.840
Will you give me Hong Hee-joo too?

13:21.133 --> 13:22.051
Well?

13:23.135 --> 13:26.680
Will Hong Hee-joo be my wife now?

14:15.104 --> 14:16.355
Park Do-jae!

14:23.445 --> 14:25.030
How touching.

14:25.114 --> 14:26.699
It really is.

14:31.745 --> 14:32.955
Get him.

14:33.038 --> 14:33.873
Go after him.

14:34.498 --> 14:35.624
Don't talk.

14:35.708 --> 14:36.667
I called an ambulance.

14:40.296 --> 14:41.297
It's true.

14:42.631 --> 14:44.550
I intentionally stayed

14:45.217 --> 14:46.302
by your side.

14:47.094 --> 14:48.095
Because…

14:49.346 --> 14:51.432
I believed you were Paik Sa-eon,

14:52.600 --> 14:54.602
who killed my brother.

14:58.856 --> 15:00.274
I can give her everything.

15:01.191 --> 15:04.612
If that's what Hee-joo wants,
I'll give as much as she needs.

15:05.863 --> 15:06.947
Then promise me.

15:07.781 --> 15:08.824
If I make an effort

15:10.659 --> 15:12.077
and we can change,

15:13.162 --> 15:16.040
promise you'll never make this call again.

15:19.835 --> 15:20.669
On the mountain,

15:22.713 --> 15:24.048
I was the one

15:25.174 --> 15:26.008
who pushed her.

15:35.434 --> 15:36.518
Change of plan.

15:37.186 --> 15:38.437
Today's D-Day.

15:39.647 --> 15:44.401
Just like when I lost my only family,

15:46.612 --> 15:47.988
I wanted you…

15:50.616 --> 15:53.994
to feel the pain
of losing someone precious to you.

15:56.622 --> 15:57.873
You got it wrong.

15:58.582 --> 16:01.126
It wasn't him. It was that bastard.

16:01.210 --> 16:03.045
Then who on earth are you?

16:03.879 --> 16:05.923
Why aren't you Paik Sa-eon?

16:07.925 --> 16:09.176
All this time,

16:10.803 --> 16:12.554
what the hell have I been doing?

16:30.197 --> 16:31.198
Park Do-jae.

16:32.157 --> 16:33.325
Park Do-jae!

16:33.951 --> 16:34.785
Park Do-jae!

16:36.036 --> 16:36.870
Wake up!

16:37.538 --> 16:38.872
Park Do-jae!

16:51.593 --> 16:52.928
It's nice to meet you.

16:53.721 --> 16:56.181
I'm Park Do-jae,
and I'm the new trainee reporter.

17:01.061 --> 17:04.440
- The Presidential Office?
- Yes, as a special administrative officer.

17:04.523 --> 17:05.566
But you know,

17:06.316 --> 17:10.237
you never know when or how
I'll be replaced as the spokesperson.

17:10.320 --> 17:12.614
It doesn't matter. It's an honor.

17:15.367 --> 17:16.618
I'll work hard.

17:17.703 --> 17:20.122
Also, thank you so much

17:21.081 --> 17:22.541
for choosing me, sir.

17:27.588 --> 17:29.840
Were you hurt?

17:37.765 --> 17:39.308
I entrusted everything to him.

17:40.267 --> 17:41.810
On the day you were kidnapped,

17:43.896 --> 17:45.856
I had him track the phone and location

17:47.024 --> 17:48.817
and get you bodyguards.

17:49.777 --> 17:51.153
On top of that,

17:53.072 --> 17:55.074
I entrusted you to Park Do-jae myself.

17:56.408 --> 17:57.659
It's not your fault.

17:58.327 --> 17:59.286
Don't blame yourself.

18:04.083 --> 18:06.335
Where did it all go wrong?

18:08.003 --> 18:09.254
He's right.

18:13.092 --> 18:15.928
I used to live here, catching fish.

19:05.060 --> 19:06.895
All of these assholes.

19:09.148 --> 19:12.901
They're all coming at me.
They must have a death wish.

19:31.295 --> 19:36.091
His first death anniversary is coming up.
In three days, right?

19:36.675 --> 19:38.552
Exactly a year ago, around this time,

19:39.178 --> 19:42.181
when I saw the news
that Paik Jang-ho had died,

19:43.849 --> 19:44.892
it all came back to me.

19:46.185 --> 19:49.855
His face was like on every channel,
and it came back to me.

19:51.023 --> 19:51.857
Help!

19:51.940 --> 19:56.778
The face of the man
who pushed me into the water.

20:06.872 --> 20:08.040
So,

20:08.874 --> 20:10.375
do you know what I thought?

20:12.753 --> 20:14.004
"What a shame."

20:15.005 --> 20:17.257
"I should've killed that bastard myself."

20:18.926 --> 20:20.344
With my hands.

20:20.427 --> 20:22.763
I should've done it myself.

20:26.058 --> 20:26.892
What?

20:28.393 --> 20:29.436
Are my hands weird?

20:33.315 --> 20:34.608
Are they dirty?

20:43.492 --> 20:44.493
Are you crying?

20:45.661 --> 20:48.247
Why? Do you pity me?

20:50.082 --> 20:50.916
No.

20:53.710 --> 20:55.128
I pity myself.

21:00.592 --> 21:01.677
I was tricked.

21:03.470 --> 21:04.638
I was told you died.

21:07.015 --> 21:09.142
No, he said he killed you.

21:09.726 --> 21:14.481
That old bastard tricked me.

21:22.072 --> 21:24.074
What the hell are you saying?

21:24.157 --> 21:27.119
You all wanted me dead and gone.

21:27.786 --> 21:31.748
Do you know
why I didn't come after you people first?

21:31.832 --> 21:34.001
Because I knew you'd kill me again.

21:35.252 --> 21:36.712
You'd lock me up again!

21:36.795 --> 21:38.213
No, no.

21:39.256 --> 21:40.465
No, my baby…

21:40.549 --> 21:41.842
My baby…

21:41.925 --> 21:44.386
- I just…
- You just what? Tell me.

21:45.262 --> 21:47.931
Are you happy I'm alive?
Are you happy to see me?

21:49.641 --> 21:50.684
I…

21:54.187 --> 21:55.022
I never…

21:57.441 --> 21:59.151
want to lose you again.

22:02.487 --> 22:04.156
I mean that.

22:09.119 --> 22:10.162
No!

22:12.706 --> 22:14.124
- Professor!
- Who are you?

22:14.207 --> 22:15.459
Get him.

22:29.931 --> 22:32.309
Get back, or else I'll kill him.

22:35.479 --> 22:36.396
See you soon, old man!

22:37.064 --> 22:39.649
I'll give you a show of a lifetime!

23:06.176 --> 23:07.177
Did you find him?

23:08.011 --> 23:09.054
No.

23:12.849 --> 23:16.144
Honey, how could you still treat him
like this?

23:16.937 --> 23:19.231
He went to hell and back!

23:19.314 --> 23:21.233
- How could you?
- Hell?

23:22.359 --> 23:25.779
He's making our lives
a living hell right now.

23:26.530 --> 23:27.656
Snap out of it!

23:43.713 --> 23:46.133
Was living ever heaven on earth for you?

23:47.634 --> 23:49.886
I don't know about you,

23:50.971 --> 23:53.390
but I've never had a single day of peace.

23:54.933 --> 23:57.102
Stop playing the victim.

23:57.185 --> 23:58.520
What if we find him?

23:59.521 --> 24:02.566
Can you proudly call him our son
in front of the world?

24:02.649 --> 24:04.609
Can you care for him all your life?

24:08.905 --> 24:09.739
He's…

24:11.491 --> 24:13.076
the monster we created.

24:15.495 --> 24:16.663
He's nothing more…

24:18.582 --> 24:20.083
and nothing less.

24:26.256 --> 24:30.260
He takes after you a lot.

24:37.642 --> 24:38.977
But do you know something?

24:41.438 --> 24:43.398
Neither you nor he

24:44.191 --> 24:46.109
takes after Paik Jang-ho.

24:46.193 --> 24:48.236
Why are you bringing that up now?

24:52.532 --> 24:54.576
There's someone else
who takes after Paik Jang-ho.

24:56.494 --> 24:57.537
What?

25:14.304 --> 25:17.641
There's nothing you can do about it
even if you find out now.

25:20.018 --> 25:21.436
Paik Jang-ho's dead.

25:23.230 --> 25:25.941
That son is rising much faster
than you are.

25:27.150 --> 25:28.318
The Paik family

25:28.985 --> 25:31.488
values the presidential race
more than life itself,

25:31.571 --> 25:32.989
and unless you give it up,

25:34.115 --> 25:35.742
what can you possibly do?

26:11.027 --> 26:13.405
Yesterday afternoon,
the Seongnang Police Station

26:13.488 --> 26:16.825
announced the arrest of a suspect
believed to be an accomplice

26:16.908 --> 26:18.535
in the Paik Sa-eon threat case

26:18.618 --> 26:21.454
and stated that his residence
had been searched.

26:21.538 --> 26:24.791
Reporter Kim Jeong-seon
has more on the details.

26:24.874 --> 26:28.712
Police investigators are raiding
the suspect's residence in Seoul.

26:29.421 --> 26:30.839
The search lasted five hours…

26:30.922 --> 26:34.634
Are they saying
that's where Park Do-jae lives?

26:35.343 --> 26:36.469
No way.

26:36.553 --> 26:37.929
What's going on?

26:38.013 --> 26:39.889
Why would he do that to Mr. Paik?

26:39.973 --> 26:41.349
Is Mr. Paik okay?

26:41.433 --> 26:44.436
I spoke with him on the phone earlier.
He didn't sound okay.

26:45.228 --> 26:47.147
Well, how can he be okay?

26:47.897 --> 26:50.859
He kept him by his side
and trusted him more than anyone.

26:52.110 --> 26:53.778
What happens now?

26:54.362 --> 26:56.906
Mr. Park will be investigated
and punished for it.

26:56.990 --> 27:00.285
And the spokesperson said
he'd clarify his position soon.

27:06.541 --> 27:08.752
We'll continue with the latest updates.

27:08.835 --> 27:12.005
While the police were investigating
the motive and circumstances

27:12.088 --> 27:14.883
of the crime with the arrested accomplice,

27:14.966 --> 27:16.926
they identified
two of the criminal's hideouts

27:17.010 --> 27:18.678
and conducted a focused search.

27:18.762 --> 27:22.974
During this process, a weapon believed
to have been used in the crime was found…

27:23.058 --> 27:25.727
- He won't pick up.
- …thoroughly investigated.

27:25.810 --> 27:28.730
Based on the unidentifiable fingerprints…

27:28.813 --> 27:29.731
PAIK SA-EON

27:29.856 --> 27:34.736
…the suspect is likely an unregistered
person with no official family ties.

27:35.862 --> 27:38.198
FATHER

27:42.827 --> 27:45.955
We're analyzing the computer hardware
obtained from Park Do-jae's residence,

27:46.039 --> 27:49.042
and it appears to have been used
for backdoor hacking.

27:49.125 --> 27:52.170
Is that how he wiretapped me
and tracked my location?

27:52.253 --> 27:56.883
Yes, but there was another target
of the hacking besides you,

27:56.966 --> 27:59.260
and we suspect it was his accomplice.

28:00.178 --> 28:01.346
The one who made the threats?

28:02.013 --> 28:05.266
So, doesn't that mean
we can track his location right now?

28:06.935 --> 28:09.145
The problem is
that the program is encrypted.

28:10.647 --> 28:13.566
We don't know
how long it'll take to decrypt it.

28:15.777 --> 28:17.529
Then to ask Park Do-jae for it

28:18.363 --> 28:19.864
would be the fastest way.

28:19.948 --> 28:22.867
Yes, but he's exercising
his right to remain silent.

28:24.035 --> 28:26.579
And as I told you, this morning…

28:28.873 --> 28:29.874
How is he?

28:30.458 --> 28:32.836
Fortunately, it's not life-threatening.

28:37.590 --> 28:38.800
PARK * JAE

28:56.568 --> 28:58.278
Serves you right.

28:58.361 --> 29:00.196
You're unbelievable.

29:02.657 --> 29:03.491
But then,

29:04.784 --> 29:06.119
it's understandable.

29:06.202 --> 29:09.122
Turns out you were helping
the culprit all this time,

29:09.205 --> 29:11.040
and he made a fool of you.

29:11.124 --> 29:12.959
You feel empty and embarrassed.

29:13.877 --> 29:15.837
I bet you wanted to disappear.

29:16.421 --> 29:19.716
You got me wrong and sought revenge
because you were deceived.

29:20.300 --> 29:24.220
But you tried to hurt Hee-joo too.
That's a different issue.

29:24.888 --> 29:27.015
That's attempted murder. You know that?

29:27.098 --> 29:29.100
You have no right to blame me.

29:29.684 --> 29:32.520
You've had a good life
living as Paik Sa-eon.

29:32.604 --> 29:34.105
- Am I wrong?
- You're right.

29:35.148 --> 29:38.401
I'll make sure everyone,
including me, pays for their sins.

29:39.527 --> 29:41.321
So help me catch him first.

29:43.156 --> 29:44.574
Don't be ridiculous.

29:44.657 --> 29:47.243
You will expose the Paik family's secrets

29:47.327 --> 29:49.204
and give up the highest power
in the country?

29:49.788 --> 29:50.789
I won't fall for it.

29:51.456 --> 29:52.499
I won't be fooled twice.

29:52.582 --> 29:54.292
Then why did you save me?

29:56.127 --> 29:57.545
Have you ever thought

29:59.589 --> 30:01.925
that I might not be the person you hate,

30:03.343 --> 30:04.427
even just once?

30:17.190 --> 30:19.025
I have no intention of showing mercy.

30:19.609 --> 30:22.153
If you want a lighter sentence,
cooperate with the police.

30:25.865 --> 30:26.699
Have you…

30:29.410 --> 30:31.079
never doubted me?

30:32.413 --> 30:35.291
Thinking you might have seen
through my true intentions,

30:36.334 --> 30:38.002
I was always on edge.

30:39.087 --> 30:39.963
Because you…

30:42.507 --> 30:44.300
could've seen right through me.

30:51.724 --> 30:53.017
I trusted you.

30:55.562 --> 30:57.188
I don't trust anyone.

30:59.440 --> 31:00.984
But I trusted you.

31:16.165 --> 31:17.166
I know it's late,

31:19.460 --> 31:20.670
but would you…

31:22.213 --> 31:23.798
consider trusting me now?

31:45.320 --> 31:47.238
YUN HYEON-SEONG

31:48.948 --> 31:50.158
So,

31:50.241 --> 31:52.994
Mr. Jeong Jin-seok raised Sa-eon,

31:53.077 --> 31:56.831
and the real son, thought to be dead,
has returned and is trying to kill Sa-eon.

31:56.915 --> 31:57.790
And that ass…

32:05.715 --> 32:07.842
And that bad guy
is the boy from the villa?

32:09.177 --> 32:10.845
You're good at summarizing.

32:11.512 --> 32:13.848
You should be hearing it
from the person involved,

32:13.932 --> 32:15.642
but I know you would've found out anyway.

32:17.268 --> 32:19.687
You can hear the rest from him.

32:22.023 --> 32:22.857
"The rest"?

32:24.859 --> 32:25.902
Is there more?

32:31.866 --> 32:33.493
Poor Sa-eon.

32:33.576 --> 32:36.120
It must've been so hard
and lonely for him.

32:38.957 --> 32:40.917
Carrying all of those secrets alone.

32:42.794 --> 32:43.962
He didn't have to act tough.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.215
Take care of him.

32:47.298 --> 32:51.469
You see, Sa-eon is not one to talk
about his personal life.

32:51.552 --> 32:54.055
But he told you. That means…

32:54.722 --> 32:55.890
the green light.

32:55.974 --> 32:57.392
"Green light"?

33:00.061 --> 33:00.895
For us?

33:01.854 --> 33:03.523
Hurry up and call him!

33:03.606 --> 33:05.817
Ask if he's eaten.
Invite him out if he hasn't.

33:05.900 --> 33:07.318
Tell him you'll eat with him.

33:09.904 --> 33:11.406
Me? Be his friend?

33:12.991 --> 33:13.992
SPOKESPERSON PAIK SA-EON

33:16.911 --> 33:17.745
Look.

33:18.746 --> 33:19.914
You guys are connected.

33:27.338 --> 33:28.506
Yeah.

33:28.589 --> 33:29.799
Hello?

33:34.429 --> 33:35.430
They found it?

33:50.611 --> 33:52.405
I'll drive.

33:52.488 --> 33:53.614
No, I'll do it.

33:54.949 --> 33:56.117
Get in.

34:08.254 --> 34:10.882
After skeletonization,
it becomes hard to identify a body

34:11.507 --> 34:13.092
as well as the time of death.

34:13.676 --> 34:15.678
Still, personal effects were found.

34:15.762 --> 34:18.056
It'd be helpful if you could confirm them.

34:25.563 --> 34:26.981
EVIDENCE

34:27.065 --> 34:28.399
This bead…

34:30.818 --> 34:31.652
is mine.

34:34.030 --> 34:35.698
I lost in a game of marbles.

34:36.991 --> 34:39.869
So I gave it to Yeong-seok.
And this is Min-woo's ring.

34:39.952 --> 34:41.954
It's a big ring though.

34:46.542 --> 34:48.211
His mom gave it to him…

34:51.047 --> 34:52.924
after promising she'll be right back.

34:54.926 --> 34:56.511
Though she didn't come back…

34:56.594 --> 34:57.428
Then…

34:58.387 --> 35:00.264
I guess that belonged to Jin-yeong.

35:01.140 --> 35:03.184
The child who loved cars. Lee Jin-yeong.

35:05.770 --> 35:06.646
Am I right?

35:36.884 --> 35:38.553
Here. Drink this.

35:42.348 --> 35:43.307
Thank you.

35:43.391 --> 35:45.476
Stop it. This is nothing.

35:47.687 --> 35:51.190
Thank you for remembering
my friends with me.

35:58.156 --> 36:00.366
You-ri, of all the people I know,

36:00.449 --> 36:01.868
you're the most cheerful.

36:03.870 --> 36:08.249
So, whenever painful memories
I didn't want to remember flooded in,

36:10.543 --> 36:12.336
I've managed to hold on.

36:15.965 --> 36:17.258
It's all thanks to you.

36:24.223 --> 36:25.224
Thank you.

36:32.398 --> 36:34.817
The real Paik Sa-eon is alive,

36:34.901 --> 36:36.569
and he's the one behind the threats?

36:37.195 --> 36:38.029
Yeah.

36:42.909 --> 36:45.161
The pieces are finally coming together.

36:48.539 --> 36:52.335
When I was young, I remember going out
to the yard after hearing Yu-jin cry.

36:58.633 --> 37:00.426
Yu-jin! Are you okay?

37:01.093 --> 37:03.971
He looked around our age,
so I thought he was Paik Sa-eon.

37:04.055 --> 37:05.264
But…

37:05.932 --> 37:07.934
when I first saw Paik Sa-eon,

37:08.017 --> 37:10.394
he was much taller than the boy I saw.

37:11.938 --> 37:14.357
So I thought maybe the boy wasn't him.

37:15.816 --> 37:19.070
The boy you saw
was probably the real Paik Sa-eon.

37:19.153 --> 37:20.571
Probably.

37:21.405 --> 37:22.740
And not long after that,

37:22.823 --> 37:24.242
the car accident happened.

37:25.868 --> 37:27.745
And the real Paik Sa-eon disappeared.

37:32.124 --> 37:32.959
Then…

37:34.252 --> 37:37.630
are you saying
the car accident might not be an accident?

37:39.840 --> 37:41.300
What if…

37:42.426 --> 37:44.637
Yu-jin saw
the face of the real Paik Sa-eon,

37:45.304 --> 37:47.765
the one the Paik family was hiding?

38:04.991 --> 38:06.742
Why didn't you answer my calls?

38:09.495 --> 38:10.621
What are you doing here?

38:11.122 --> 38:13.207
No, how dare you come here?

38:14.458 --> 38:17.128
Are you really trying to push Hee-joo out
and take her place?

38:19.005 --> 38:20.006
Why are you smiling?

38:20.756 --> 38:21.841
Did I say something funny?

38:23.134 --> 38:25.386
Hee-joo, let's talk later.

38:26.095 --> 38:26.971
I should go.

38:29.140 --> 38:32.018
They're making a fuss over catching
the culprit and the accomplice.

38:32.101 --> 38:33.144
What's going on?

38:33.227 --> 38:36.188
If this keeps up,
won't it affect the presidential race?

38:36.272 --> 38:39.400
What if you can't become
the future president's daughter-in-law?

38:41.527 --> 38:44.655
I should've just married you off
to the Yeonghwa Construction family.

38:44.739 --> 38:46.741
I was wrong.

38:50.328 --> 38:51.162
No.

38:52.872 --> 38:55.541
It's not my fault. She's the problem.

38:55.624 --> 38:58.336
This happened because that wench
ran off before the wedding!

38:58.419 --> 38:59.545
I regret it too.

38:59.628 --> 39:01.505
What?

39:01.589 --> 39:03.716
I regret loving you.

39:04.925 --> 39:05.760
No.

39:06.510 --> 39:08.512
That wasn't love.

39:09.138 --> 39:09.972
You…

39:11.682 --> 39:14.393
Now that In-a's talking,
are you talking too?

39:16.187 --> 39:17.730
I thought being obedient

39:18.939 --> 39:20.900
was a way to show you love.

39:21.817 --> 39:22.902
If I did as you said,

39:23.694 --> 39:26.947
I thought you'd love me back one day, but…

39:30.785 --> 39:32.119
HOME

39:33.621 --> 39:34.830
Now that I've been loved…

39:36.749 --> 39:38.459
and loved someone, I know.

39:42.046 --> 39:43.297
Love…

39:45.007 --> 39:47.760
isn't about forcing
one-sided sacrifice like you do

39:48.677 --> 39:51.555
or being unconditionally obedient like me.

39:53.224 --> 39:54.183
"Sacrifice"?

39:55.393 --> 39:57.144
Did I do this for my own benefit?

39:58.104 --> 40:00.606
I did it because I wanted something better
for you!

40:00.689 --> 40:02.441
Stop gaslighting me!

40:05.111 --> 40:06.821
I won't listen to you anymore.

40:09.073 --> 40:10.074
Also, I'll never be

40:12.243 --> 40:14.245
the president's daughter-in-law.

40:16.497 --> 40:17.915
So wake up, please.

40:30.469 --> 40:31.387
How dare she,

40:32.054 --> 40:33.889
after everything I've done for her!

40:39.728 --> 40:40.729
Drink this.

40:48.154 --> 40:49.989
How did I forget?

40:53.075 --> 40:55.911
Do you remember the DNA report
from before?

40:55.995 --> 40:57.830
I said I didn't know who sent it.

40:59.081 --> 40:59.915
Yeah.

40:59.999 --> 41:02.293
I think I now know who sent it.

41:03.961 --> 41:05.045
Who?

41:44.919 --> 41:45.836
Hong Hee-joo.

42:04.396 --> 42:05.814
It's our wedding vows.

42:12.988 --> 42:15.824
You don't need to read it all.
Just remember this.

42:16.825 --> 42:20.246
One, the groom cannot initiate a divorce.

42:20.329 --> 42:23.499
Two, divorce is prohibited
under any circumstances.

42:23.582 --> 42:26.585
Three, we will actively announce
to the public

42:26.669 --> 42:28.587
that we are a married couple.

42:29.588 --> 42:31.131
If any of these are violated,

42:32.007 --> 42:32.967
the penalty…

42:34.718 --> 42:35.928
will be two billion won.

42:37.471 --> 42:38.639
What are you doing?

42:40.224 --> 42:42.893
I understand what it means now.

42:44.853 --> 42:48.899
For me, it was way before that.

42:50.901 --> 42:52.611
Way before.

42:52.695 --> 42:54.655
You said "way before."

42:55.698 --> 42:57.449
I don't know exactly when that is,

42:58.033 --> 43:00.536
but I'm certain
that it was before three years ago.

43:02.746 --> 43:03.747
Before the wedding,

43:04.873 --> 43:07.126
the person who sent the DNA report to In-a

43:08.294 --> 43:09.295
was you, wasn't it?

43:25.811 --> 43:29.356
Is Hong Hee-joo marrying the son
of the Yeonghwa Construction family?

43:29.440 --> 43:30.774
Is that true?

43:32.318 --> 43:36.155
The only woman willing to sell
her daughter to him is Hee-joo's mom.

43:36.238 --> 43:39.158
The wedding will be held
as planned tomorrow.

43:39.241 --> 43:41.160
However, let's switch the bride.

43:41.243 --> 43:44.246
It won't be you. It'll be your sister.

43:45.831 --> 43:47.416
I wasn't a stand-in.

43:49.918 --> 43:51.587
From the very start,

43:53.672 --> 43:55.424
I was your wife.

44:01.263 --> 44:03.223
Once all of this is over,

44:07.770 --> 44:09.480
will you marry me?

44:19.948 --> 44:20.866
No.

44:23.952 --> 44:25.663
Once all of this is over…

44:32.127 --> 44:33.837
I'll propose to you.

45:02.825 --> 45:03.826
I love you,

45:05.452 --> 45:06.578
Hong Hee-joo.

45:38.944 --> 45:41.238
Of the four discovered remains,

45:41.321 --> 45:44.825
three were identified
with the help of personal items,

45:44.908 --> 45:46.285
but for the remaining one,

45:47.119 --> 45:48.370
we have no clue.

45:48.454 --> 45:51.540
It will take some time
to analyze the remains and see

45:52.374 --> 45:53.459
if the DNA matches yours.

45:53.542 --> 45:54.418
INCIDENT REPORT

46:19.234 --> 46:20.819
YUN HYEON-SEONG

46:24.448 --> 46:26.241
Hyeon-seong!

46:26.325 --> 46:28.327
Hyeon-seong!

46:28.410 --> 46:29.703
Hyeon-seong!

46:30.496 --> 46:32.915
Where are you?

46:33.665 --> 46:36.251
Come out!

46:36.960 --> 46:38.212
Hyeon-seong!

46:52.893 --> 46:55.646
I found my friends thanks to you.
Thank you.

46:57.147 --> 46:59.900
There's still one unidentified person.

47:03.070 --> 47:04.404
One of the twins?

47:06.490 --> 47:07.324
Yes.

47:32.266 --> 47:34.101
I was going to self-destruct too.

47:34.810 --> 47:36.311
After I get my revenge,

47:37.854 --> 47:42.317
once the goals and targets
that kept me going were gone,

47:45.612 --> 47:47.614
I was going to disappear too.

47:48.865 --> 47:49.700
What about now?

47:52.661 --> 47:54.121
Did you change your mind?

47:58.333 --> 47:59.167
Of course.

48:01.253 --> 48:03.380
I'm going to live a life
after taking revenge.

48:04.631 --> 48:05.924
With the person

48:08.468 --> 48:10.804
I want to be with for the rest of my life.

48:17.978 --> 48:19.104
Will you try it again?

48:26.320 --> 48:27.863
It's a shame your brother died,

48:28.447 --> 48:30.949
but what about the rest of your life?

48:35.662 --> 48:37.331
This is all because of him.

48:37.956 --> 48:41.251
How many lives need to be destroyed
before this comes to an end?

48:43.503 --> 48:44.504
It's not…

48:46.923 --> 48:48.091
over yet.

48:49.551 --> 48:51.011
We have to catch him.

48:52.304 --> 48:53.305
After that,

48:55.432 --> 48:57.601
I'll think about what comes next.

49:00.729 --> 49:02.439
I was relieved.

49:04.274 --> 49:05.275
When I learned

49:07.277 --> 49:11.990
that you weren't the Paik Sa-eon
I thought you were.

49:27.881 --> 49:28.715
I'm in.

49:28.799 --> 49:29.675
How many?

49:30.217 --> 49:32.636
Park Do-jae said he planted spy chips
and tracking devices

49:32.719 --> 49:35.055
in all the mobile devices
and transportation the guy uses.

49:35.138 --> 49:38.684
Out of the three, two are inactive,
but one is still active.

49:38.767 --> 49:41.353
Check the GPS and pinpoint
the exact location, quickly.

49:44.940 --> 49:48.151
I heard Sa-eon caught the accomplice.

49:48.777 --> 49:50.070
What about the culprit?

49:50.987 --> 49:52.197
We found out

49:53.740 --> 49:55.701
who the culprit is.

49:59.830 --> 50:01.039
Who is it?

50:05.168 --> 50:06.253
I knew it.

50:07.045 --> 50:08.380
You're not surprised at all.

50:09.673 --> 50:13.176
But then, I guess you already knew.

50:13.260 --> 50:16.263
Nothing gets by you
in this family, Father.

50:16.346 --> 50:19.474
Just finish what you were saying.
Who's the culprit?

50:19.558 --> 50:22.519
Before I tell you,
I have to ask you something.

50:24.229 --> 50:27.023
The reason you covered up
our car accident.

50:28.150 --> 50:30.569
What deal did you make
with Chairman Paik Jang-ho?

50:44.958 --> 50:46.918
The bastard who ran my kids over.

50:47.836 --> 50:51.006
I chased him to the Philippines
and got him to confess

50:51.673 --> 50:53.800
just before I was about to take his life.

50:54.468 --> 50:56.219
So don't try to deny it.

50:56.762 --> 50:59.556
Have you calculated it thoroughly?

51:00.849 --> 51:02.517
After you shoot me,

51:03.268 --> 51:04.519
what will you have left?

51:05.979 --> 51:09.399
You invested tens of billions of won
in my presidential campaign.

51:10.108 --> 51:11.526
You already lost your son.

51:12.110 --> 51:16.323
And if you shoot me,
you'll also lose the money.

51:16.406 --> 51:17.574
Are you okay with that?

51:18.909 --> 51:20.035
You know me well.

51:20.535 --> 51:25.415
You know I'm someone who's more sensitive
to losses than to gains.

51:25.499 --> 51:29.377
Would it be a little better
if the losses weren't all on you?

51:30.962 --> 51:34.716
By now,
they should be walking side by side.

51:36.343 --> 51:37.219
What does that mean?

51:37.803 --> 51:39.554
On the road to the afterlife.

51:40.764 --> 51:43.141
Your son and my grandson.

51:44.267 --> 51:45.268
How's that?

51:46.520 --> 51:48.855
Is it starting to add up now?

51:52.025 --> 51:53.485
Tell us now.

51:53.568 --> 51:55.612
What did you throw away?

51:55.695 --> 51:57.113
And what did you gain?

52:42.951 --> 52:45.036
Hurry and come to the memorial service.

52:45.620 --> 52:46.872
I've got a bad feeling.

52:52.586 --> 52:53.545
Mr. Hong.

52:54.796 --> 52:55.714
Mr. Hong.

52:59.134 --> 53:00.760
What do you think you're doing?

53:05.015 --> 53:05.849
YUNHWA-RI

53:05.932 --> 53:08.685
We got it.
He's near Yunhwa-ri, Sanseong-myeon.

53:08.768 --> 53:10.270
We got the bastard.

53:11.062 --> 53:12.898
- Head out.
- Yes, sir.

53:16.359 --> 53:17.652
Didn't I warn you?

53:19.237 --> 53:23.491
That if that thing in your family
was still alive,

53:24.242 --> 53:26.703
I'd chop it up from head to toe

53:26.786 --> 53:28.163
and scatter the pieces.

53:30.999 --> 53:32.167
Give him to me.

53:34.669 --> 53:36.588
Where is he?

53:51.728 --> 53:53.647
Guards!

54:24.135 --> 54:25.261
It's a fire! Evacuate!

54:29.724 --> 54:31.226
Dad!

54:31.309 --> 54:32.686
We have to go!

54:33.687 --> 54:35.355
It's a fire!

54:41.403 --> 54:43.488
- Yes, Detective Kang.
- We got his location.

54:43.571 --> 54:46.616
We're on our way
to Yunhwa-ri 24, Sanseong-myeon.

54:47.909 --> 54:48.910
Where?

54:50.453 --> 54:51.413
Are you okay?

55:13.852 --> 55:16.396
I can't find Hee-joo! We were together.

55:17.313 --> 55:18.148
I'll find her.

55:19.274 --> 55:20.358
Hee-joo!

55:21.401 --> 55:22.235
Hee-joo!

55:27.615 --> 55:28.742
Hee-joo!

55:31.494 --> 55:33.538
UNKNOWN CALLER

55:37.000 --> 55:38.168
Paik Sa-eon.

55:39.836 --> 55:43.923
I'll kill her.
I'm really going to kill her.

55:44.883 --> 55:45.800
Your wife.

55:55.602 --> 55:56.936
I know now

55:57.687 --> 55:58.897
for sure

55:58.980 --> 56:02.233
what you cherish most in the world.

56:02.317 --> 56:03.568
Hee-joo.

56:03.651 --> 56:04.986
Answer him, Sis.

56:05.070 --> 56:06.404
Your husband's calling.

56:06.488 --> 56:07.489
Paik Sa-eon!

56:08.865 --> 56:10.617
If you lay a finger on her,

56:10.700 --> 56:11.785
I'll kill you.

56:12.494 --> 56:13.328
Let her go now.

56:14.037 --> 56:15.413
I'm the one you want.

56:15.497 --> 56:17.957
Don't mess with anyone else.
Settle this with me.

56:18.625 --> 56:20.001
Don't get worked up.

56:20.085 --> 56:23.630
I get excited when you get worked up.

56:26.132 --> 56:29.928
Your turn will come soon,
so don't make a fuss and just wait.

56:30.011 --> 56:33.389
You're far from being ruined.

56:33.473 --> 56:35.683
Paik Jang-ho's grandson

56:36.267 --> 56:39.687
being successful
and perfectly fine, just like you,

56:39.771 --> 56:42.232
that's exactly what that old man wanted.

56:43.149 --> 56:44.984
I can't let that happen.

56:46.236 --> 56:48.905
I'll make him rise up from his grave!

56:49.697 --> 56:52.325
This is just a little taste.

56:53.034 --> 56:56.079
You don't know what real pain is yet.

56:56.162 --> 57:00.333
I really want you to suffer properly.

57:00.917 --> 57:01.918
Why?

57:04.420 --> 57:05.380
Because…

57:06.965 --> 57:08.049
Help!

57:10.051 --> 57:10.885
Help!

57:15.431 --> 57:16.558
Help me!

57:16.641 --> 57:18.810
Because you just watched me

57:19.686 --> 57:21.438
dying in pain.

57:23.148 --> 57:24.983
So I'm going to watch too.

57:28.653 --> 57:31.573
I'll watch you struggle,
begging for your life,

57:33.491 --> 57:35.660
on the verge of choking.

57:36.453 --> 57:40.165
You should experience
that kind of torment for once.

57:40.248 --> 57:42.417
That once pleasant scent from your body

57:43.126 --> 57:47.172
will turn into the pungent smell of blood.

57:47.255 --> 57:48.465
I'll make you suffer.

57:56.973 --> 57:58.057
UNKNOWN CALLER

57:58.683 --> 58:00.685
Hee-joo, don't worry.

58:00.768 --> 58:01.895
I'm coming.

58:01.978 --> 58:03.897
- I'm coming right now.
- Don't come.

58:08.234 --> 58:09.652
I told you.

58:11.613 --> 58:12.947
For once,

58:13.990 --> 58:15.617
I want to protect you.

58:18.161 --> 58:20.163
Just remember this.

58:22.081 --> 58:23.249
I love you…

58:28.046 --> 58:29.631
so very much.

58:31.299 --> 58:32.300
Hee-joo.

58:32.383 --> 58:33.760
I love you.

58:39.766 --> 58:41.601
You crazy bitch! Again with that?

58:42.435 --> 58:43.811
Do you remember?

58:43.895 --> 58:46.356
Once you start,
you see it through to the end.

58:46.439 --> 58:47.982
That's what you said.

58:48.066 --> 58:49.317
Since I started it,

58:50.109 --> 58:52.111
I'm going to end it.

58:52.195 --> 58:54.906
I'll make sure
you never make him suffer again!

59:04.624 --> 59:05.667
Hee-joo…

59:06.709 --> 59:07.710
Hee-joo!

59:39.701 --> 59:41.494
The accident vehicle has been lifted,

59:42.287 --> 59:45.832
and the search team is using boats
to search the surrounding area.

59:45.915 --> 59:47.959
A vehicle that fell into the upper stream

59:48.042 --> 59:50.461
of the Cheonghan River
this morning has been found.

59:51.170 --> 59:52.964
The impact of the crash was so severe

59:53.548 --> 59:55.675
that the guardrail
was completely torn off.

59:56.259 --> 01:00:00.638
The rescue team found the vehicle
at a depth of about 20 meters,

01:00:00.722 --> 01:00:03.850
but the passengers
have not been found yet.

01:00:03.933 --> 01:00:05.852
According to the police investigation,

01:00:05.935 --> 01:00:08.688
this vehicle that crashed into the river
was being driven by…

01:00:11.774 --> 01:00:16.154
Paik Sa-eon's wife after being abducted.

01:00:16.237 --> 01:00:17.905
This news has left many in shock.

01:00:17.989 --> 01:00:21.618
The police have released
a composite sketch of the suspect

01:00:21.701 --> 01:00:23.870
and issued an emergency wanted notice.

01:00:23.953 --> 01:00:25.747
In relation to this, Spokesperson Paik

01:00:25.830 --> 01:00:28.041
will hold a press conference
to announce his position.

01:00:28.124 --> 01:00:29.751
- There he is.
- There he is.

01:00:29.834 --> 01:00:33.087
Hurry! Take photos of him.

01:00:52.315 --> 01:00:54.275
That's enough! Please!

01:00:54.359 --> 01:00:57.278
This isn't a scandal. It's an incident!
A criminal case!

01:01:14.504 --> 01:01:18.091
First, I have something to say
to the people.

01:01:20.009 --> 01:01:21.135
For a long time,

01:01:22.887 --> 01:01:24.555
I've kept something hidden.

01:01:26.474 --> 01:01:27.392
I am…

01:01:29.268 --> 01:01:31.270
not the son of Presidential Candidate…

01:01:33.106 --> 01:01:34.065
Paik Ui-yong.

01:01:35.066 --> 01:01:38.069
I am not the grandson…

01:01:39.696 --> 01:01:40.947
of Chairman Paik Jang-ho.

01:01:44.283 --> 01:01:45.576
Both the name Paik Sa-eon

01:01:46.744 --> 01:01:48.996
and my identity as Paik Ui-yong's son

01:01:50.331 --> 01:01:51.624
are all fake.

01:01:51.708 --> 01:01:53.418
SPOKESPERSON PAIK,
"I'M NOT PAIK SA-EON…"

01:01:53.501 --> 01:01:54.502
It does not belong to me.

01:01:57.004 --> 01:02:01.008
If there is one thing
I can say truthfully about myself,

01:02:03.469 --> 01:02:04.303
it's that…

01:02:06.347 --> 01:02:09.934
I'm married, and I have a wife.

01:02:10.977 --> 01:02:14.188
My wife was kidnapped
on the 20th, two days ago,

01:02:14.272 --> 01:02:18.693
by the person who had been threatening
to kill me.

01:02:19.444 --> 01:02:21.571
Investigations and searches are ongoing,

01:02:21.654 --> 01:02:25.324
but my wife's whereabouts
have not yet been determined.

01:02:26.075 --> 01:02:28.161
In relation to this, I stand before you

01:02:28.244 --> 01:02:30.204
not as Spokesperson Paik Sa-eon

01:02:30.705 --> 01:02:32.123
but as…

01:02:33.624 --> 01:02:34.709
a husband,

01:02:35.293 --> 01:02:36.627
to humbly request

01:02:38.296 --> 01:02:41.883
your cooperation and help.

01:02:55.772 --> 01:02:57.106
My wife's name is…

01:02:57.857 --> 01:02:59.358
Hong Hee-joo.

01:03:00.151 --> 01:03:03.654
She's 28 years old, 167cm tall…

01:03:03.738 --> 01:03:04.822
That's Hong…

01:03:04.906 --> 01:03:06.365
Did you not know either?

01:03:06.449 --> 01:03:09.911
At the time of her disappearance,
she was wearing a black suit

01:03:09.994 --> 01:03:13.456
and black shoes
and had long, straight hair.

01:03:20.379 --> 01:03:24.425
And she's the sign language interpreter
of the Presidential Office.

01:03:25.343 --> 01:03:27.637
I look forward
to working with you as well.

01:03:30.473 --> 01:03:32.225
Is there something you want to do?

01:03:32.308 --> 01:03:33.601
Well…

01:03:36.646 --> 01:03:37.647
There is.

01:03:37.730 --> 01:03:41.609
Things that I never imagined
we could do together.

01:03:42.652 --> 01:03:44.195
I know it's ridiculous,

01:03:44.779 --> 01:03:47.532
but I imagined it sometimes.

01:03:48.783 --> 01:03:50.117
Us being…

01:03:51.160 --> 01:03:53.663
completely ordinary
just like everyone else.

01:03:57.625 --> 01:03:59.460
There's a lot I haven't done for her.

01:04:00.378 --> 01:04:01.712
Let's be happy together.

01:04:03.256 --> 01:04:05.675
I haven't made her happy yet.

01:04:06.843 --> 01:04:08.427
Once all of this is over…

01:04:13.558 --> 01:04:15.309
I'll propose to you.

01:04:16.644 --> 01:04:18.729
If I had known I wouldn't get the chance,

01:04:21.065 --> 01:04:23.359
I would've just given her everything.

01:04:25.278 --> 01:04:27.780
SPOKESPERSON PAIK
DEVASTATED BY HIS WIFE'S ABDUCTION

01:04:27.864 --> 01:04:29.115
Hee-joo…

01:04:30.867 --> 01:04:32.118
Please.

01:04:32.869 --> 01:04:34.620
If anyone has seen my wife,

01:04:35.872 --> 01:04:37.164
please report it now.

01:04:37.248 --> 01:04:39.792
Please, I ask for your attention and help

01:04:40.918 --> 01:04:44.589
so that my wife can return safely.

01:05:27.298 --> 01:05:30.217
WHEN THE PHONE RINGS

01:05:43.022 --> 01:05:44.231
Why was I born?

01:05:45.900 --> 01:05:46.984
I always thought about it.

01:05:48.778 --> 01:05:51.447
If I have to live someone else's life
against my will,

01:05:52.448 --> 01:05:54.158
why was I born?

01:06:00.831 --> 01:06:02.750
But I think I found the answer.

01:06:04.085 --> 01:06:05.503
To why I was born

01:06:06.212 --> 01:06:08.798
and why I had to live as Paik Sa-eon.

01:06:10.633 --> 01:06:11.550
It was…

01:06:17.723 --> 01:06:18.766
to meet you.

01:07:15.823 --> 01:07:17.867
Subtitle translation by: Sue Mounce
